OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charge after man, 24,
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a 24-year-old was stabbed to
OL,8,Fdeath in a park.
OL,10,FZherko Rasul Osman suffered serious
OL,11,Fstab wounds on Chapel Street in the
OL,12,FLevenshulme area of Manchester just
OL,13,Fafter 19:00 BST on Saturday and died at
OL,14,Fthe scene.
OL,16,FGlenn Shitama, 23, of no fixed abode,
OL,17,Fhas been charged with the murder and
OL,18,Fpossession of a bladed article in a
OL,19,Fpublic place, Greater Manchester Police
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
